1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,261
The payment went through in seconds, so when does the money reach the store?

2
00:00:04,261 --> 00:00:08,761
At the end of the day, the processing center settles all card payments with the bank.

3
00:00:08,761 --> 00:00:11,750
The money lands on the store's terminal account at the bank.

4
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:16,809
The bank keeps its fee and moves the rest to the store's own account by the next banking day.

5
00:00:16,809 --> 00:00:21,154
The store also gets a daily report to match every payment with its books.

